2adf66d1-9503-4481-94c2-fb2dda973470	Ultra-Sleek 16-in-1 Multitool	You can spend a lifetime looking for the perfect Multitool (and many of us probably feel like we have). No matter which one you try, no matter how good the reviews are, some aspect of it feels missing. Not so here. Every component of this one is fully thought through and purpose-built to function well. The expected are a high carbon 30Cr13 stainless steel pliers (needle nose and regular) with wire cutters, a 50Cr15MoV knife for cutting and peeling, and a locking saw with interlaced teeth for double the cutting power. But the real improvement here is in the scissors – usually a miniature afterthought, but here a full-sized tool with a 38mm blade and full-size grip to slice through paper, cloth, rope and more. And for emergency uses, the sickle-style line cutter can slice through seat belts quickly, and the nano-ceramic glass breaker that can smash through tempered glass in one hit. Philips and flathead screwdrivers, can/bottle openers, and a ruler make this a tool that can do just about anything, and do it well. A handy tool to keep in your tool box or drawer or on your belt.	79	https://garrettwade.com/cdn/shop/files/16in1MultiTool_main_12T0116__97600.1660061493.1280.1280.jpg?v=1766158394&width=1920	https://chirpy.st/u23413_scmwNG	Hand Tools, Tool Accessories, DIY & Crafts, Garden & Outdoor	Garrett Wade	2026-04-14 22:38:43.971306+00	f	2026-04-14 22:38:43.971306+00	2026-04-14 23:47:15.117046+00	Build & Maintain, Touch Grass	\N	f	https://garrettwade.com/products/ultra-sleek-16-in-1-multitool	\N	\N	0	\N	{US}	ultra-sleek-16-in-1-multitool	\N	\N	{}	active	0	\N	\N	\N	f	aca97532-aeff-4e11-8aca-aea99cf81a5a	\N	\N
