e9e47ca0-2513-4690-88b0-223bfabd81b3	Set of 4 Italian Pasta Rolling Pins	These beechwood rolling pins are a nod to traditional Italian pasta making, including both a traditional smooth pin and three unique pasta-cutting rolling pins: spaghetti, tagliatelle, and pappardelle. To use, start by following your favorite pasta recipe, rolling your dough into a 6 ½” wide sheet. From there, choose your preferred roller and roll with firm pressure; you’ll cut a handful of fresh noodles with each pass. Roll out the scraps with the smooth pin and repeat until you’re ready to cook! If you have little ones around, they’ve probably used similar tools during playtime, and they’ll love trying out the real thing to help make their own buttered noodles. Used on its own, the straight rolling pin is the quintessential baking aid, fashioned from unfinished beechwood and measuring 17" L with a 1 3/4" diameter. It takes pressure from an open palm and allows you to control your rolling precisely to create an even, uniform thickness. The simple design, without handles, does not collect flour or dough, is easier to clean, and does not mark the dough's surface. Care Details: Wash & dry the pins; do not put them in the dishwasher. All of these rolling pins are made in Italy and sure to become a kitchen favorite.	38.5	https://garrettwade.com/cdn/shop/files/39A0606-Pasta4RollerSet3500A__14737.1732055721.1280.1280.jpg?v=1766157715&width=1920	https://chirpy.st/u23413_BIPbll	Cookware & Bakeware, Kitchen Storage, DIY & Crafts	Garrett Wade	2026-04-14 22:23:14.764476+00	f	2026-04-14 22:23:14.764476+00	2026-04-14 23:47:16.380646+00	Build & Maintain, Kitchen Flex	\N	f	https://garrettwade.com/products/set-of-4-italian-pasta-rolling-pins	\N	\N	0	\N	{US}	set-of-4-italian-pasta-rolling-pins	\N	\N	{}	active	0	\N	\N	\N	f	aca97532-aeff-4e11-8aca-aea99cf81a5a	\N	\N
