1012c79e-d206-466b-843c-0c8df87f9fb0	Garrett Wade Push Drill & Yankee Screwdriver Set	A Garrett Wade Exclusive. We’ve often thought these two tools are a perfect pair. Functionally, they complement each other really well. Generations of woodworkers, DIYers, and installation professionals got the job done with this manual drill and screwdriver set! Sadly, a few decades ago, the manufacturer stopped making these essential tools. Garrett Wade has brought back both tools as a set! They are custom-made to our exacting specifications. They are exceptionally useful tools you'll use for decades. We think they should both be in every shop and job site tool bag. Drill & Driver Details Exceptionally well made with chrome-plated, solid brass, both the Yankee Screwdriver and Yankee push drill are beautifully finished. The Push Drill comes with eight traditional double fluted bits (1/16”, 5/64”, 3/32”, 7/64”, 1/8", 9/64”, 5/32”, 11/64"). As you push down, the bit rotates clockwise, cutting the hole. When you stop pushing, the handle springs up and the bit rotates in the reverse direction — essentially self-clearing. This set can make a hole up to 1-1/2" deep. The included drill drill bits are made as they were a generation ago, to clear chips efficiently. They are not twist bits, these are true double fluted bits. The Yankee Screwdriver works in the same way, pressing in on the spring-loaded handle rotates the chuck to turns and drives the bit with minimal effort. Repeated presses will drive in your screw with ease, and a simple flick of a switch reverses the gearing for loosening and removing screws. Includes four bits to cover most common uses, including: 4.5mm Phillips/flathead 5.5mm Phillips/flathead Phillips 3S2 (blunt and wide) Size 7 flathead With its built-in quick-release hex head, the Yankee Screwdriver will accept any standard hex bit from your collection. This model is identical to our previous one, apart from the addition of a brass chuck, which we quite like. It measures 9-¾” closed and 12-½” extended. 08C03.30 Yankee Screwdriver Best-Sellers at Garrett Wade The Garrett Wade Yankee Screwdriver has long been one of our bestselling, most popular items, and we’d just like to say: Welcome Back! While it had been unavailable for some time, we’re thrilled to announce we’ve brought it back and it’s better than ever. It should be in your “quiver” for any project! Discover why we love the Yankee Screwdriver so much when you order your set today!	147.9	https://garrettwade.com/cdn/shop/files/08C0330-YankeePushDrill_Screwdriver__75492.1704904410.1280.1280.jpg?v=1766155615&width=1920	https://chirpy.st/u23413_jVOcOc	Hand Tools, DIY & Crafts, Office & Stationery	Garrett Wade	2026-04-14 22:16:23.115357+00	f	2026-04-14 22:16:23.115357+00	2026-04-14 23:47:08.04036+00	Build & Maintain, Soft Academia	\N	f	https://garrettwade.com/products/garrett-wade-push-drill-yankee-screwdriver-set	\N	\N	0	\N	{US}	garrett-wade-push-drill-yankee-screwdriver-set	\N	\N	{}	active	0	\N	\N	\N	f	aca97532-aeff-4e11-8aca-aea99cf81a5a	\N	\N
