047c24db-714a-41a1-809f-48ad9343313f	Professional Task Light	This 940 Lumen LED task light resembles an ordinary “extension lamp” found on a clerk’s desk or shop table. It attaches to any edge by means of a 2" capacity screw-on clamp, rotates 360˚ around this base and has 32" extension arm with a “knee” in the middle that allows it a generous amount of reach. Despite its appearance, it is a professional-grade, fully adjustable task lamp, with heavy-duty construction and a great variety of controls and features. Adjustable Task Lamp The overall function is excellent, but the magical aspect to it is that the Hood contains 60 LEDs arranged in two rows. Each row of the LED task light has its own color of LED bulbs. One puts out blue-white bright light equivalent to daylight. Its “color-temperature” is close to Kelvin 6500K. The other row emits a classic incandescent yellow light common in most traditional interiors (3500K). Both rows come on when the switch in the hood is pressed. That’s only the beginning, as each row has its own adjusting power button with 4 levels of output. The end result is you have 16 adjustable lighting options and can select the light quality that suits you best – perhaps one choice in the morning but then a different choice at dusk. The adjustable task lamp’s hood is 3" wide and 19" long. It rotates up and down 180˚ and side-to-side, lockable in any position. Powered by the included standard household plug. Quite simply, it’s fantastic. We’ve never seen anything like it. Highly recommended.	105	https://garrettwade.com/cdn/shop/files/16t0105_protasklight_main__89934__81298.1593447466.1280.1280.jpg?v=1771448537&width=1920	https://chirpy.st/u23413_EwsK3o	Hand Tools, Lighting, Office & Stationery	Garrett Wade	2026-04-14 22:22:33.532634+00	f	2026-04-14 22:22:33.532634+00	2026-04-14 23:47:11.041554+00	Build & Maintain, Soft Academia	\N	f	https://garrettwade.com/products/professional-task-light	\N	\N	0	\N	{US}	professional-task-light	\N	\N	{}	active	0