d1d74c69-414c-4e1b-9af4-a5573078b4b1	Coffee Aficionados Gift Set	This set is for true coffee enthusiasts—those of us who aspire to brew the finest, most personalized cup of coffee imaginable, fully in control of every aspect of the brewing process. Using only the power of your muscles and the heat of a stovetop flame, you can achieve coffee perfection. It all starts with our Italian-made hand-crank coffee grinder, which features and all-metal construction and seasoned beechwood base and knob. Meticulously crafted, its tempered steel conical grinding system allows for fine-tuned, precise coarseness control—a must for optimal flavor extraction. And since everything happens using the hand crank, there’s no risk of scorching your coffee (a genuine risk with blade-style grinders). Once your beans are ground, the brewing begins. While there are countless brewing methods out there, no fad or gadget can top a simple, perfectly made espresso—and our Italian-made Stainless Steel Stovetop Espresso Maker couldn’t be easier or more satisfying to use. Once your grounds and water are in place (full instructions are included), place the included Double Walled Stainless Espresso Cup on the built-in platform and place over a medium flame. After only a couple of minutes, a dark, rich stream of delicious brew will fill your cup. From there you can enjoy your drink as-is or use it to create your favorite coffee drinks, from flat whites to red-eyes, Americanos to iced lattes. This purely analog, electricity-free set will change your coffee game forever.	218.45	https://garrettwade.com/cdn/shop/files/57A01.14_Espresso-Kit_WebSilo__75737.1665774945.1280.1280.jpg?v=1766154870&width=1920	https://chirpy.st/u23413_kYjNN1	Coffee & Tea, Kitchen Storage, Hand Tools	Garrett Wade	2026-04-14 22:30:25.866721+00	f	2026-04-14 22:30:25.866721+00	2026-04-14 23:47:11.599403+00	Build & Maintain, Quiet Luxury	\N	f	https://garrettwade.com/products/coffee-aficionados-gift-set	\N	\N	0	\N	{US}	coffee-aficionados