cfcdf35f-f7be-4541-9991-3b9f6e0f307a	Formula 1 Quartz Men's Black Steel Watch, 41mm	<p>TAG Heuer's distinctive Formula 1 Watch makes a classic statement in fine-brushed stainless steel with hand-applied indices, a racing-inspired second hand with red tip, and a unidirectional bezel with engraved numerals and signature black shield.</p><p></p><h3>Features</h3><ul><li><p>From the TAG Heuer Formula 1 collection</p></li><li><p>Built on a 41mm-diameter steel case with pressure-proofing screw-down crown and case back, and triple-row steel bracelet with rigorously tested safety clasp</p></li><li><p>The shimmering black dial sports the TAG Heuer shield in the house's signature white, green and red, and boldly luminous hour markers and hands</p></li><li><p>Bezel turns only in one direction, allowing error-free timing of activities for up to an hour</p></li><li><p>Stainless steel; sapphire crystal</p></li><li><p>Case size: 41mm</p></li><li><p>Water resistant to 20 ATM</p></li><li><p>Deployment clasp</p></li><li><p>Quartz movement</p></li><li><p>Back opalin dial</p></li><li><p>Date window</p></li><li><p>Unidirectional brushed steel bezel with engraved numerals</p></li><li><p>STYLE #WAZ1112.BA0875</p></li><li><p>Photo may have been enlarged and/or enhanced</p></li><li><p>Manufacturer's 2-year limited warranty</p></li><li><p>Made in Switzerland</p><p></p></li></ul><h3>About the brand</h3><p>In 1860, Edouard Heuer started designing timepieces in Saint-Imier, Switzerland at the age of 20. The crown-operated, keyless winding system was his first patent, which changed the course of watchmaking history. Continuing his pioneering legacy, the Swiss luxury brand has gone on to introduce numerous innovative patents and timeless designs, deeming it one of the most advanced and luxurious watchmakers in the world.</p><p></p><p></p>	2000	https://images.bloomingdalesassets.com/is/image/BLM/products/5/optimized/8958505_fpx.tif?wid=1500	https://chirpy.st/u23413_hsBcZB	Fashion, Men's Fashion, Me