89420202-adcc-4192-baef-fc199c2be2f1	Navy Blue Tulip Linen Set	Timeless, refined, and distinctly European, our new Tulip Linen Collection celebrates the storied beauty of the tulip, a motif deeply woven into the fabric of European design history. Each Oven Mitt is crafted from our signature high-quality 100% cotton and finished with a delicate hand-embroidered tulip design in merlot red, blending heritage artistry with effortless, modern elegance. The tulip holds a rich and symbolic past, revered by the Ottoman Empire as a symbol of abundance, beauty, and perfection, before making its way into 17th-century European design, where it became synonymous with prosperity and grace. Over time, the motif found new life across cultures — from the romantic gardens of the French countryside to Hungarian folk embroidery, where it came to represent love, renewal, and connection to nature. Translated through etúHOME’s classical European lens, our Tulip Collection honors this cross-cultural heritage with a modern sensibility, a celebration of craftsmanship, history, and timeless beauty designed for today’s home. Set includes: Dinner Napkins, Set of 4 Over Mitts, Set of 2 Pot Holders, Set of 2 Kitchen Tea Towels, Set of 2	202.36	https://etuhome.com/cdn/shop/files/blue-tulip-collection_1024x1024.png?v=1775833579	https://chirpy.st/u23413_oZEbvN	Kitchen & Dining, Home Decor, Dining & Entertaining	Fast Bundle	2026-04-15 05:57:38.907411+00	f	2026-04-15 05:57:38.907411+00	2026-04-15 05:57:41.044284+00	Bloom & Glow, Quiet Luxury, The Atelier	\N	f	https://etuhome.com/collections/linens/products/navy-blue-tulip-linen-set	\N	\N	0	\N	{US}	navy-blue-tulip-linen-set	\N	\N	{}	active	0	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	\N	\N
