0ec3f3bc-4468-4fa8-a741-3325960c836e	Women's Boston Clogs	Features Narrow width (A/B). A Birkenstock narrow width is equivalent to a women's medium width (B). Available in full sizes only; if between sizes, order the next size up Functional buckle at side for a flexible fit Contoured footbed supports the arch of foot and cradles heel for all-day comfort Round toe Slip on Suede upper and lining, EVA sole Made in Germany about the brand Consciously healthy, effortlessly chic, BIRKENSTOCK creates elevated, comfortable shoes informed by tradition and history--and made with heritage craftsmanship. At the heart of every BIRKENSTOCK design is the brand's anatomical footbed for happy, healthy feet and all-day comfort. And for more than 200 years, BIRKENSTOCK has led the way in sophisticated footwear for men, women, and kids that is as classic as it is modern and as trend-forward as it is timeless. Not only does BIRKENSTOCK create shoes that are good for you, but the brand works to ensure that its shoes and its business practices are also good for people and the planet. With its commitment to meeting stringent social and environmental standards, the company has, since 1774, worked to embrace what is now known as "corporate social responsibility." By using natural, renewable materials, like cork and jute, as well as quality craftsmanship, BIRKENSTOCK shoes are naturally durable. And thanks to the brand's vertical integration, it can tightly monitor its business practices and those of its partners for ethical conduct. Further, the company takes an active role to help solve the challenges facing society--enabling the brand to help create a better world for future generations. Shipping & Returns California and Minnesota customers call 1-800-777-0000 for Free Shipping information. Please call customer service for returns. For complete details, see our Shipping and Returns policies. View more	169.95	https://images.bloomingdalesassets.com/is/image/BLM/products/1/optimized/12151341_