cc609673-cd37-411a-8172-f9555ed6e021	Meyer Lemon	Improved Meyer Lemon – A Sweeter, More Resilient CitrusGrow your own citrus. No backyard required.The Improved Meyer Lemon is a compact, easy-to-grow citrus plant that produces fragrant flowers and sweet, juicy lemons with a subtle hint of orange. Whether styled as a classic tree with a defined trunk or a fuller, bushier form, both offer the same homegrown flavor and four-season appeal.Perfect for patios, balconies, or sunny indoor spots, this variety is well-suited for small spaces and container growing — so fresh lemons are always within reach for cooking, cocktails, or a simple squeeze.Why you’ll love it:Homegrown flavor: Sweeter than traditional lemons with a hint of orangeCompact + versatile: Ideal for containers, patios, balconies, or small gardensYear-round interest: Glossy evergreen leaves, fragrant blooms, and bright fruitLow-maintenance: Easygoing and beginner-friendlyWhat’s the difference between bush and tree? It’s all in the pruning. The tree form has a more defined trunk, while the bush is fuller with branching throughout. Both stay compact and are equally suited for small-space growing.What makes it “Improved”? This variety was bred to be more disease-resistant than earlier Meyer lemon plants, making it a more reliable and resilient option for home growers.Care notes: Provide plenty of bright light and water as needed. In warmer climates (zones 8–11), it can live outdoors year-round. In cooler regions, keep it in a container so you can bring it indoors when temperatures drop.Bundle with our Lemon Tree Care Kit to keep your tree healthy and productive!	139	https://www.thesill.com/cdn/shop/files/MeyerLemonKitchen_TheSill.png?v=1774382498&width=1200	https://chirpy.st/u23413_XSCSAx		The Sill	2026-04-18 18:18:40.955176+00	f	2026-04-18 18:18:40.955176+00	2026-04-18 18:18:40.955176+00	\N	\N	f	https://www.thesill.com/products/improved-meyer-lemon-bush?variant=42450549669993	\N	\N	0	\N	{US}	meyer-lemon	\N	\N	{}	