4416db97-f189-44ed-af87-0e1743491fa1	Limited-edition Box Set of Prints — Carmen at San Francisco Ballet in Black & Red	<div>A limited-edition box set of 25 archival pigment prints by photographer Nikolai von Bismarck, captured during the World Premiere of <i>Carmen</i> at San Francisco Ballet. The performance was presented as part of <i>Dos Mujeres</i>, the company’s first-ever double bill featuring works by Latina choreographers.</div><div><br></div><div>Captured through von Bismarck's lens, the photographs document Gabriela Hearst's costume design debut for choreographer Arielle Smith's reima<span data-markjs="true" class="outlook-search-highlight">gina</span>tion of <i>Carmen</i> premiered in April 2024, Hearst designed the costumes crafted entirely from merino wool— one of the thinnest, highest-performance natural fibers — dressing the dancers in ribbed sets in vibrant red, sunflower yellow, and black to accentuate the body and enhance movement on stage.</div><div><br></div><div>von Bismarck's photography captures the raw physicality and emotional intensity of the production. The box set is designed as a collectible object: each of the four pages with tipped-on prints is perforated at the spine, allowing an individual print to be framed.</div><div><br></div><div>Available in three color combinations: red/black, yellow/black, black/red at the New York Beverly Hills and London stores.</div>	2200	https://gabrielahearst.com/cdn/shop/files/GabrielaHearst_011426_0326_v2_2000x.jpg?v=1769180157	https://chirpy.st/u23413_JEhUlc	Books, Home Decor, Textiles	Gabriela Hearst	2026-04-13 12:24:00.41106+00	f	2026-04-13 12:24:00.41106+00	2026-04-19 16:29:46.322841+00	Quiet Luxury, The Atelier	\N	f	https://gabrielahearst.com/products/san-francisco-ballet-prints-box-set-black-red?variant=47224828985536	\N	\N	0	\N	{US}	limited-edition-box-set-of-prints-carmen-at-san-francisco-ballet-in-black-red	\N	\N	{}	active	0	\N	\N	\N	f	dd03b7f5-8455-4b6a-87e6-2c6ef73dc03c	\N	\N
